mbtserver
------------------------------------------
Server extension of mbt

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libicu76-76.1-2
  libmbt-devel-3.13-1bl1
  libmbt2-3.13-1bl1
  libmbtserver-devel-0.17-1bl2
  libmbtserver2-0.17-1bl2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libticcutils10-0.38-1bl2
  libtimbl8-7.0-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  autoconf-archive-2026.11.11-1
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  libmbt-devel-3.13-1bl1
  libticcutils-devel-0.38-1bl2
  libtimbl-devel-7.0-1bl2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/mbtserver

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/mbtserver/archive/refs/tags/v0.17.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mbtserver-0.17-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mbtserver-0.17-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mbtserver-0.17-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mbtserver-0.17-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmbtserver2-0.17-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmbtserver-devel-0.17-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(mbtserver)
  /usr/bin/mbtserver.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/mbtserver.README
  /usr/share/doc/mbtserver/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/mbtserver/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/mbtserver/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/mbtserver/README
  /usr/share/doc/mbtserver/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/mbtserver/TODO
  /usr/share/doc/mbtserver/examples/eindh.data
  /usr/share/doc/mbtserver/examples/eindh.test
  /usr/share/man/man1/mbtserver.1.gz

(libmbtserver2)
  /usr/bin/cygmbtserver-2.dll

(libmbtserver-devel)
  /usr/include/mbtserver/MbtServerBase.h
  /usr/lib/libmbtserver.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/mbtserver.pc

